    <title value="Scenario 1.1 - Serve BgZ resources of XXX-Helleman"/>
    <description value="Qualification of scenario 1.1 - of the [Retrieve BgZ informatie use case](https://informatiestandaarden.nictiz.nl/wiki/MedMij:V2020.01/FHIR_BGZ_2017). See [the test file on the Nictiz wiki](https://informatiestandaarden.nictiz.nl/wiki/MedMij:V2020.01/BgZ_Raadplegen) for more information."/>
